=== M1: T0-T3 capability tiers ===
--- MODEL_ROUTING_POLICY.tiers ---
  T0: deterministic - no LLM: SQL, graph, AST, parsing, validation, tests, generation
  T1: lightweight - classification, extraction, formatting, routine small edits
  T2: strong-engineering - normal implementation, debugging, integration, substantial test work
  T3: frontier - orchestration, major architecture, difficult R&D, high-impact refactor, critical security, governance evolution, independent final audit

--- Runtime tier routing ---
  task_class: governance
  minimum_tier: T3
  reasoning: high
  candidates: 0
  chosen: None

